# Offline-model evaluation workspace.
# The tooling (*.py / *.sh / *.md / models.txt / colab_eval.ipynb) IS committed.
# Model weights, run outputs, logs, and caches stay local. Result JSONs are
# ignored by default but a curated set is force-added (git add -f) so the
# leaderboard is reproducible — see single_turn_results/FINDINGS_offline_model_eval.md.
ollama_models/
runs/
*.log
*.jsonl
__pycache__/
# Single-turn archives (moved under single_turn_results/ on 2026-07-06). Their
# result JSONs are force-added (git add -f) so the leaderboard stays
# reproducible; results2_md/ is the Markdown-vs-XML experiment scratch (local).
single_turn_results/results/
single_turn_results/results2/
single_turn_results/results2_md/
cloud_models_md.txt
# multi_turn_results/ (Improved Eval 3): JSONs are tracked like results3/ was
# (not ignored); only *.log inside is ignored by the rule above.
